h-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"af512ff12fc735c62a5c3eaf8ef564614e3ea32999be2e524e41af5065ceed79","event_uuid":"25d73681-d085-4749-906f-40d92373468b","position":{"commit_sha":"74788a24f4174edb0fc5392a21fe0747988464e5","position":"1787081728326721001-25d73681-d085-4749-906f-40d92373468b"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787081615601659001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"03ef6987-b664-479e-8673-f52ea09ff390","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"29a9-3cf7-3ded-42d8"},{"link_uuid":"f3c0a7dc-8c11-48f7-9868-f11fc8d2df81","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"075b-1479-dcb7-40ab"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nOperators need an authoritative configuration precedence/source/lifecycle reference and a security reference, and those docs must stay byte-current with the config schema and the ownership/secret-name registries rather than drifting by hand.\n\n## Outcome\nA new `scripts/gen_config_reference.py` generates the configuration precedence/source/lifecycle reference into `docs/config.md` and a new indexed `docs/security.md` from the config schema plus the ownership and secret-name registries; `docs/README.md` and `docs/architecture.md` navigation are updated; and a drift check (portable, run under `make lint`) fails when the generated docs are stale. The reference covers every lifecycle, precedence, restart/redeploy rotation, native-refresh, observability-exception, subprocess-limitation, and behavior-delta topic named in the epic.\n\n## Plan\n1. Implement `scripts/gen_config_reference.py` modelled on `gen_env_registry.py`/`gen_cli_reference.py`, sourcing the schema + ownership/secret-name registries.\n2. Generate `docs/config.md` (precedence/source/lifecycle) and `docs/security.md` (indexed security reference); update `docs/README.md` and `docs/architecture.md` navigation.\n3. Wire a byte-current drift check into `make lint` (portable/no-CI path), mirroring `check_docs_index.py`.\n\n## Testing (RED -> GREEN)\n- The drift check fails when a generated doc is stale (a deliberate edit to the generated region trips it) and passes when docs are regenerated.\n- The generated reference contains a section for every named topic: config precedence/source/lifecycle, MCP/CLI exposure, restart/redeploy rotation, native refresh, observability exception, subprocess limitations, and explicit behavior deltas.\n- The generator and drift check run under `make lint` with no CI provider present (portable path).\n\n## Compatibility / rollback\nDocs-and-tooling only; no product-behavior change. Rollback removes the generator, `docs/security.md`, and the drift-check wiring and restores the prior `docs/config.md`.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Generated config/security/operator docs are byte-current with the schema and ownership/secret-name registries; the drift check (run under `make lint`, no CI dependency) fails when they are stale.\n- [ ] The generated reference covers every lifecycle, precedence, restart, observability, subprocess, and behavior-delta topic named in the epic, and `docs/README.md`/`docs/architecture.md` navigation reference the new/updated docs.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"scripts/gen_config_reference.py","reason":"NEW doc generator from schema+registries."},{"path":"docs/config.md","reason":"Regenerated precedence/source/lifecycle reference."},{"path":"docs/security.md","reason":"NEW indexed security reference."},{"path":"docs/README.md","reason":"Nav update."},{"path":"docs/architecture.md","reason":"Nav update."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["depends_on","075b-1479-dcb7-40ab"],["depends_on","29a9-3cf7-3ded-42d8"],["parent","aabf-d89e-d05a-45c4"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"aabf-d89e-d05a-45c4","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"3199-d739-8804-4746","ticket_type":"task","title":"RP-04 S7.4 — Generate config/security/operator docs from registries + drift check","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["eb619129-1a17-4beb-bbbf-e746e36fcd72","03ef6987-b664-479e-8673-f52ea09ff390","f3c0a7dc-8c11-48f7-9868-f11fc8d2df81","25d73681-d085-4749-906f-40d92373468b"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787089243756153001,"uuid":"1c6dea84-62d9-461f-8682-7956b6ae4bbd"}